SUMMARY:Fig Festival\, Sykia
LOCATION:Sykia\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:A young festival (4th edition in 2025) in the hill village of Sykia west of Sitia\, on the evening of 22 August: fresh and dried figs\, fig sweets and raki\, with local lyra players (Fasoulas and Kallergis in 2025) and a 5-euro entry. Small and friendly\; go for the food rather than a big stage.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#sykia-fig-festival-sykia
